binary is added to or distributed with WarpTweet, the distribution must include
the exact corresponding upstream license and copyright notices. The upstream
portable OpenSSH license is available at:

https://github.com/openssh/openssh-portable/blob/V_10_4_P1/LICENCE

The Linux production OpenSSH executables statically incorporate OpenSSL 3.5.7
libcrypto built from authenticated upstream source. OpenSSL is licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0. Distributions must include the corresponding
OpenSSL LICENSE.txt without modification. The upstream source and license are
available at:

